<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>MPI 지수 | Matths Exchange</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/brand/matths-exchange-x-32.png" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any" href="/images/brand/matths-exchange-x.svg" />
  <script src="/js/exchange-theme.js"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/exchange.css" />
  <script src="/js/exchange-chart.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/exchange-mpi.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include("partials/exchange-header", { exchangePage: "mpi" }) %>
  <main id="exchange-mpi" class="terminal" data-state="<%= JSON.stringify(initial) %>">
    <section class="market-bar mpi-summary" aria-labelledby="mpi-title">
      <div class="market-identity">
        <h1 id="mpi-title">MPI 지수</h1>
        <p id="mpi-market-name"><%= initial.market?.title || "맵쓰 주간 모의고사" %></p>
        <p id="mpi-bot-policy" <%= initial.market?.botParticipation ? "" : "hidden" %>><%= initial.market?.bootstrap
          ? "잠정 MPI에는 Exam Bot 점수가 포함될 수 있습니다. 최종 정산에는 학생 성적을 사용합니다."
          : "학생 성적과 운영 봇의 생성 점수를 같은 비중으로 반영합니다." %></p>
        <label class="market-select" id="mpi-select-wrap" hidden>회차 <select id="mpi-select" aria-label="회차 선택"></select></label>
      </div>
      <dl class="market-metrics">
        <div><dt id="mpi-value-label"><%= initial.market?.bootstrap ? "잠정 MPI" : "공개 MPI" %> · 30분 지연</dt><dd id="mpi-value">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>평균 원점수</dt><dd id="mpi-score">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>유효 응시 인원</dt><dd id="mpi-count">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>지수 계산 시각 · KST</dt><dd id="mpi-time">—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>제출 반영 기준 · KST</dt><dd id="mpi-cutoff">—</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
    <section class="panel mpi-panel" aria-labelledby="mpi-chart-heading">
      <header class="panel-heading">
        <h2 id="mpi-chart-heading">MPI 캔들</h2>
      </header>
      <%- include("partials/exchange-chart-controls", { intervals, activeInterval: initial.interval }) %>
      <output class="candle-summary" data-candle-summary aria-label="MPI 시가·고가·저가·종가"></output>
      <div class="chart-area">
        <canvas id="mpi-chart" role="img" aria-label="MPI 캔들"></canvas>
        <div class="chart-empty" id="mpi-empty" <%= initial.candles.length ? "hidden" : "" %>>
          <strong>MPI 공개 대기</strong>
          <p id="mpi-waiting"><%= initial.market
            ? `${initial.market.botParticipation ? "학생과 운영 봇 합계" : "유효 응시"} ${initial.minimumMpiAttempts.toLocaleString("ko-KR")}명부터 집계하며, 집계 30분 뒤 공개됩니다.`
            : "주간 모의고사 회차가 공개되면 집계가 시작됩니다." %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <footer class="chart-foot"><span id="mpi-connection" role="status"></span></footer>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
